<title>FINLAND: Finnish December GDP rises 6.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish December GDP rises 6.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 6.2 percent year-on-year in December, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.4 percent in December on November, SF said.</p>
<p>			  Dec 1996	Nov 1996	Dec 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +6.2 pct	+4.4 pct	+1.7 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		+0.4 pct	+0.3 pct	+0.1 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
